	(text "MCU STM32H743VIH6 (TFBGA-100), jako MicoAir. Piny podle hwdef MicoAir743v2, kuličky podle symbolu KiCad.\nNapájení podle ST AN4938 kap. 2.2: 100 nF na každý VDD + 4,7 µF; VDDLDO 4,7 µF; VCAP1+VCAP2 spojené, 2× 2,2 µF;\nVDDA 100 nF + 1 µF; VDD33USB z VDD, 100 nF + 1 µF; VBAT na VDD + 100 nF; PDR_ON 10k na VDD; BOOT0 10k na GND.\nPlný popis a zdroje: dps/aio/NAVRH.md"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d35542bc-f046-5ed2-8b7a-450d29f28549")
	)
	(text "NENAKRESLENO (rozhodne se ručně):\n- konektory: GPS (GPS_*, EXT_SDA/SCL), MTF-02P (FLOW_*),\n  XR1 Nano (RC_TX/RC_RX), Bluetooth (UART1 nebo UART8)\n- RGB LED na LED_R/G/B (aktivní v nule), bzučák na BUZZER\n- volné PWM5, 7, 9–11 na pady\n- obrys 36 × 36 mm, díry 26 × 26 (Pavo20)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30.48 205.74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "4ce38ca1-275e-5511-aded-cd9213aca067")
	)
	(text "Y301: CL 12 pF, C = 2 × (CL − Cstray) = 2 × (12 − 5) = 14 → 15 pF [AN4938, AN2867].\ngm_crit = 4·ESR·(2πf)²·(C0+CL)² ≈ 0,5 mA/V (ESR 180 Ω, C0 ≤ 5 pF) < Gmcritmax 1,5 mA/V [DS12110]."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 106.68 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "83ad5297-a963-5a4b-b9f2-a55542c7f5f2")
	)
	(text "U302: SPL06-001 a DPS310 mají stejné pouzdro i piny (jako BMP280).\nCSB a SDO na 3,3 V → I2C, adresa 0x77. Osadit podle skladu JLC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 330.2 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "609a898d-f976-5af5-b304-c964722f33d2")
	)
	(text "U303 BMI088 jako MicoAir: SPI2, PS = GND (SPI),\nSDO1+SDO2 = MISO, INT1 = data ready akcel., INT3 = gyro."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 266.7 177.8 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "53d4e729-19e4-53de-8c03-ccd09640aceb")
	)
	(text "J302 microSD na SDMMC1, pull-upy 47k na CMD a D0–D3 (SD: 10–100k)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 251.46 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9835b03e-dcb8-53df-97f3-a14c1ff042ad")
	)
